# save: 09-MondoMole
# Sweep segment 09 -> 10, IN PROGRESS (identical so far): the Happy Happy drug store phone out to
# Lilliput Steps (Happy Happy's east cave; the spiral walk, Auto Fight battles, overworld Lifeup
# alpha), Mondo Mole (manual: Paula PSI Shield alpha on both, then Ness bashes, Paula bashes while
# the mole's PSI shield is up; a first take lost at L23/L16 to homesickness turns and was cut),
# the Lilliput Steps melody, back down the spiral, Happy Happy, the valley cave, Peaceful Rest
# Valley reversed (switchback, log bridge, west bank), the Twoson cave rooms, Twoson, Polestar
# Preschool (Paula's father: farewell, FLG_POLA), the phone call, Burglin Park, Everdred
# (Wad of bills). Recorded in chunks with playtest/sweep/rec.py
# late-pads: the port replays the pads the original read after each lag-merged frame
# Doors: skip K / lag K+20 / ignore: idle K+30; other idle masks are post-battle fade-ins.
# The preschool and Everdred's house doors change the music to a track with its own sample
# pack: the original's load spends 2 (preschool) / 1 (Everdred) more CPU-time frames, so their
# pairs carry 3 / 2 lag lines.
# party 25323-25560: Ness's HP meter rolls up from the sanctuary heal through the first battle
# after it; the original's roller phase (FRAME_COUNTER & 3) shifts at the battle-entry lag
# (docs/known-original-behaviour.md, rolling meter row), 1 HP apart for ~190 frames
